{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eff530663fd23c1d60c10d4a5c00c800386c9642ff32180ab94f04873e80503f", "ja": "やよい、お疲れ様！\n素晴らしいステージだったぞ！", "zh": "弥生，辛苦了！\n你的表演非常棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "0e04d7e8bb85d6cd1cdc0b4b5bfe4679b648246c112555d53873bb4d133c93ec", "ja": "おつかれさまでしたー！\n{$P$}、ハイ、ターッチ！", "zh": "辛苦了──！\n{$P$}，好，击──掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_1002", "source_sha256": "84c29e7000290de00eaf61887e7ab5f7a175ed6d7a15577b604d361cb5338884", "ja": "ハイタッチ！", "zh": "击掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2000_005yay", "source_sha256": "1257f5b41a73b773ebaba55a719d2ee3c9263dd8f6bd423f0025f7af194c89d4", "ja": "いぇい！\nえへへへっ……とっても楽しかったですー！", "zh": "耶！\n嘿嘿嘿……好开心喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2001_p", "source_sha256": "0f18778c0bd87793e00cb02ff83670135948dc9ba907d2f64d981e2546d539e7", "ja": "そうだろうな。\n客席もすごい盛り上がりだったし、大成功だ！", "zh": "我想也是。\n观众席的气氛也很热烈，演出十分成功喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2002_005yay", "source_sha256": "f954cbbb1093be7d9f3a2f3365249bc749e39ddb67d74119dae8efab7acccc5b", "ja": "はい！　すごかったんですよ！\nみんなの熱気が、私のところまで、ぶわぁ～って！", "zh": "是啊！真的好厉害！\n大家的热气都哗～地传到我这边来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2003_005yay", "source_sha256": "edd6db70aa52bf3e50051322b772a09c7ce3d66b94c11359c83ae6dc08852f1b", "ja": "それに、リンクがキラキラーって\n色んな色で輝いて、すっごくキレイでした！", "zh": "而且，溜冰场上有好多颜色闪闪发亮，\n非常漂亮喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2004_p", "source_sha256": "b3ffb12269a9702abae055ca322919bf9a8fbfcd62df7a3914582d0e80bd3b3b", "ja": "ライトが氷に反射して、\nこのステージならではの輝きになっていたな……。", "zh": "灯光在冰的反射下，\n成为这个舞台独特的光辉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2005_p", "source_sha256": "bcf25866a3b9d06ff262de95078bce9ebe6031f7ecb7e0fbd5e8365cba42b4c7", "ja": "やよいもキラキラした光に包まれて、\nすごく幻想的なライブだったよ。", "zh": "弥生也笼罩在闪闪发亮的光辉中，\n让演唱会的气氛显得十分梦幻呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2006_005yay", "source_sha256": "50838ce36ecc332471f7209bdbbdae001abeeb0d019f5bfbf72744a0906a1d7c", "ja": "えへへ……。私、スケートリンクのライブ、\nまたやりたいです！", "zh": "嘿嘿……\n我还想再办一次溜冰场上的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2007_p", "source_sha256": "a0c9bbef5f3d0c28a7694365b1489bb4dfe9f416580cfd2444801c227147de46", "ja": "ああ！　これだけ盛り上がったんだから、\n再演して欲しいって声も出てくるよ。でも今は……。", "zh": "好啊！这次的回响这么热烈，\n一定会有很多人希望加演的。不过现在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2008_p", "source_sha256": "9e61940f3abebf73be3d4e8313bc32ee71d3b31222e6131095e5b7dbc6949b3c", "ja": "アフターケアをしないとな。衣装でも寒さ対策は\nしてるけど、想像以上に体が冷えているはずだぞ。", "zh": "得做好演唱会后的保暖才行。\n就算服装能御寒，但你的身体应该比想像中来得冰冷喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2009_005yay", "source_sha256": "45501b4259f1c7bf01d258e25acf57b7ab5e49e961ba1a94386a6bfeb8dfaa44", "ja": "えっ？　そうなんですか？\n私の体……アツアツの、ホカホカですよ？", "zh": "咦？会吗？\n可是我的身体……感觉热烘烘、暖呼呼的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2010_p", "source_sha256": "2ac980b35dac8b6a845bd76bc7e376fef704a914f4aefc76277b5c32bb1b6fe1", "ja": "今は気持ちが高ぶっているから、\nそう感じるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "那是因为你现在情绪高昂，\n才会有这种感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2011_p", "source_sha256": "020d78736fb09a179d2343854052a6a161b007601a6eee93037c0097ed8eec9f", "ja": "ずっと寒い場所にいたわけだし、汗もかいているから、\nすぐに着替えて体を暖めないと、風邪をひくぞ。", "zh": "但长时间待在低温的地方加上又流了不少汗，\n不马上换掉服装、好好保暖的话会感冒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2012_005yay", "source_sha256": "1f7ebccac4156605668fa0a4beb575662b10e9ad331946f8e5566964f0cd0d1e", "ja": "ほわぁ～……そうなんですね！\n{$P$}、わかりました！", "zh": "哇啊～原来是这样！\n{$P$}，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2013_005yay", "source_sha256": "ad2dbefafa4c50a9a39d458eaf53ad6e93f1818ee89ce844caf60ad48c5f2e9b", "ja": "今日の晩ごはんは、アツアツホカホカの\nもやしラーメンにして、体を暖かくします！", "zh": "今天晚餐就煮热腾腾暖呼呼的豆芽菜拉面，\n好好暖暖身子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2014_p", "source_sha256": "c6cd4894bf3fa8ad8bdb92a6c2e6494ad158525f9d4d4dbf7ebb2d174cc5a846", "ja": "そうだな、暖かい物を食べるのが一番いいと思う。", "zh": "是啊，吃点热的食物应该是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2015_005yay", "source_sha256": "bbad51ebe773deffbb9d01ccbfd532586ee53c47db69d4c3565798db4386f4a8", "ja": "あっ！　そういえば、今日はキャベツが安いんでした。\n卵も切らしちゃったし、それから、それから……。", "zh": "啊！对了，今天的高丽菜很便宜。\n鸡蛋也用完了，还有、还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2016_005yay", "source_sha256": "9937b4ae00d0684539e3b83e113e96c8f2b54c5ff377747fc2b2b37eccd95e77", "ja": "はわっ！　大変ですー！　のんびりしてたら、\nタイムセールに間に合わなくなっちゃうかも！", "zh": "哇！不好了──！我悠哉过头，\n可能要赶不上限时特价了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2017_005yay", "source_sha256": "3681e59522345d0283a60fcb87947c5264ea50a25200c8cc459558902d71feed", "ja": "私、急いで着替えてきますね！\n{$P$}、お疲れ様でした！", "zh": "我马上去换衣服！\n{$P$}，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2018_p", "source_sha256": "68d1b51537b72265fced2a193d217302661e66b513b9dfa439881d06c93b434a", "ja": "（さっき幻想的なライブを終えたばかりなのに、\n今はもう家庭的な顔に戻っている……）", "zh": "（才刚结束一场如梦似幻的演唱会，\n却一转眼就恢复成顾家的一面……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0094_2019_p", "source_sha256": "c2ca3f2e7d41f8905385987c595ae0fe03ad19ed376f6418cdfae331f723fa55", "ja": "（このギャップも、やよいの魅力なんだろうな）", "zh": "（这样的反差也是弥生的魅力吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
